# ── Media Folders & GitHub 100 MB Push Limit Protection ────────────────────
# Ensure media directory structure, subtitles, metadata, covers and url.txt are tracked:
!public/media/
!public/media/**

# Ignore heavy video binaries by default (GitHub enforces a 100 MB per-file limit)
public/media/**/*.mp4
public/media/**/*.mkv
public/media/**/*.avi
public/media/**/*.webm
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm

# To un-ignore a specific small demo clip under 50 MB, add an exception like:
# !public/media/series/demo/s1/e1/sample.mp4
